    {
      "id": "2121098574414884959",
      "text": "The #FlaPanthers rallied from a 4-1 deficit late in the second to beat the #RedWings on Thursday night thanks in part to a Gus Forsling goal and two from Anton Lundell. Postgame from Paul Maurice, Lundell, Forsling, and Carter Verhaeghe now ➡️ https://t.co/aKNSq5adBH https://t.co/ewzBCuq13d",
